@startuml
title Figure 4.8: Sequence Diagram of the Setup Project Environment.
actor User
participant "Vue\n(Import.vue)" as Vue
participant "Rust\n(env.rs)" as Rust
participant "Python\n(venv / pip)" as Py
database "SQLite\n(projects)" as DB

User -> Vue: select project folder
Vue -> Rust: validate_project_directory(path)
Rust --> Vue: validation result
Vue -> Rust: detect_python_env(path)
Rust --> Vue: {pythonPath, venvExists, dependencies}

alt no virtual environment
    Vue -> Rust: create_virtual_env(path)
    Rust -> Py: python -m venv .venv
end

loop missing dependencies
    Vue -> Rust: install_dependencies(packages)
    Rust -> Py: pip install <pkg>
    Rust --> Vue: event install_step
end

Vue -> Rust: add_project(name, path, interpreter)
Rust -> DB: INSERT projects
DB --> Rust: project id
Rust --> Vue: project id

note over Vue, Rust: optional entry from Dashboard:\nclone_repository -> git clone -> add_project
@enduml
